 TripAdvisor announced its annual Travelers' Choice awards for the best beaches in the world. Baia do Sancho on Brazil's Fernando de Noronha island is the No. 1 beach on the global list for the second year in a row, while Grace Bay in Turks and Caicos ranks second. TripAdvisor created regional and national lists of top beaches, including those for Africa, Asia, the Caribbean, Europe, South America, the South Pacific, the United Kingdom, and the United States.

